      ],
      "explanation": "NF<sub>3</sub> has no vacant orbital neither in nitrogen nor in fluorine so it cannot\naccept the electron &amp; hence cannot acts as lewis acid and but for PCl<sub>5</sub> P has\nno L.P &amp; hence it cannot acts as base but ClF3 (3 B.P + 2 L.P) &amp; SF<sub>4</sub> (4 B.P +\n1 L.P)"
